In the OpenAPI schema:
```json
"schema": {
  "anyOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Cat"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Dog"
    }
  ],
  "title": "Pet"
}
```
It's missing the `discriminator` field. For a tagged union, it should have something like:
```json
"schema": {
  "anyOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Cat"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Dog"
    }
  ],
  "discriminator": {
    "propertyName": "kind"
  },
  "title": "Pet"
}
```
